tg — your Telegram account for agents and scripts. What it reads stays on your computer; search,
review and tasks work offline.

Usage: tg <profile> <command> [options]
Account commands start with your profile, a name you choose; none is ever assumed.

What you can do:
  review 'date>1d'        what changed in every chat since yesterday
  tasks agenda            tasks due, replies you owe, replies you wait for
  inbox --transcribe      unread in every chat, voice as text; marks nothing read by default
  search all invoice      messages and notes, from the local store and Telegram's server
  attachments extract     text of PDFs and documents, ready for search
  schedule agent …        an agent on a timer; it runs read-only and can never send
  mcp --permission …      your account in any agent, with messages.send=deny
  TG_READ_ONLY=1 tg …     a run that can read and sync but never send, edit or delete

Works with:
  max                     MAX in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  wa                      WhatsApp in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  zm                      Zoom meetings: transcripts and summaries, searchable with your messages
  drive                   Google Drive and Docs as local text, searchable with your messages
  memo context <person>   one person across messengers, mail, notes and meetings

Start here:   tg personal setup  (any profile name works)
              tg account list    your profiles and their logged-in accounts
Next:         tg commands        every command, by section
